  "title": "Apple Ugly Cake",
  "description": "Don&#39;t let the name of this recipe fool you. It may not be the prettiest cake you&#39;ve ever seen, but it sure is the delicious! It is a quick apple and raisin cake that anyone could make. I&#39;ve made this for a tea party, office luncheon, brunch and dessert. It&#39;s always a hit. Delicious served with vanilla ice cream.",
